AEGEES is one of the most secure messengers in the world which can send messages, create chats, voice and video group calls. It is designed to prevent its user from becoming a subject of supervision or surveillance.

It incorporates the most advanced information security technologies with the convenient usability of regular internet messengers.

AEGEES messenger app allows you to:
• message in chats and conferences;
• make voice/video calls and take part in audio/video conferences;
• create personalized channels and subscribe to them;
• develop and connect bots;
• store confidential data in an encrypted container.
The only thing that we know about you is the two 256-bit random numbers, a SHA256 algorithm calculated hash from your login and password. It is absolutely impossible to find out your real login and password from this hash.


AEGEES provides security of communications required by people, whose professional success and personal safety depend on the security of information they share.

To access all the features of the application, you need to sign up for a monthly subscription. See the Terms of Use and Privacy Policy (link below) to learn more about the subscription and the information we collect.  

The Terms of use and Private Policy: https://aegees.com/privacy_policy.html
